<guide-layout bind:__l="__l" uI="3e20ef50-0" uS="{{['d']}}">
  <section-card
    bind:__l="__l"
    uI="3e20ef50-1,3e20ef50-0"
    uS="{{['title','content']}}"
  >
    <view slot="title">交易时间</view>
    <view slot="content">适用于港交所的持续交易时段（9:30-16:00）</view>
  </section-card>
  <section-card
    bind:__l="__l"
    uI="3e20ef50-2,3e20ef50-0"
    uS="{{['title','content']}}"
  >
    <view slot="title">成交价格</view>
    <view slot="content"
      >投资者需指定价格进行交易，系统只会在该价格或更优的价格（对于买方来说更低的价格，对于卖方来说更高的价格）上进行撮合成交。</view
    >
  </section-card>
  <section-card
    bind:__l="__l"
    uI="3e20ef50-3,3e20ef50-0"
    uS="{{['title','content']}}"
  >
    <view slot="title">订单价格</view>
    <view slot="content"
      >输入卖价可低于最佳买价最多9个价位，输入买价可高于最佳卖价最多9个价位</view
    >
  </section-card>
  <section-card
    bind:__l="__l"
    uI="3e20ef50-4,3e20ef50-0"
    uS="{{['title','content']}}"
  >
    <view slot="title">注意事项</view>
    <view slot="content">增强限价盘不可用于竞价时段，否则会导致废单</view>
  </section-card>
</guide-layout>
